{
  "name": "Screen",
  "comment": "The browser on PlangOS's screen: Chromium drawing onto the display, its first page an app window (no tabs, no\ntoolbar) that becomes the desktop. DevTools speaks over its pipe (fd 3 and 4), no port. It starts on plang's own blank\npage (an app window needs a real page; about:blank opens a tab): the page it shows is the caller's to give, over the\npipe — never on this command line.\nTrusted by origin (579): this goal ships with plang, so it starts Chromium without asking — only because it names\nthe program, every flag and the environment itself. %!app.AbsolutePath% and %!app.OsAbsolutePath% are the app's own\nanchors (no caller sets them); any other variable here would make the start the caller's, and asked.",
  "step": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "delete file '/.browser/SingletonLock', on error 'NotFound' ignore",
      "line": {
        "number": 12
      },
      "comment": "a Chromium that was killed (PlangOS closed hard) leaves its profile's lock naming its process; in a new PlangOS\nanother process can have that number, and the new Chromium would hand its page to \"the running one\" and exit.\nNone of ours runs yet: the lock is stale.",
      "code": [
        {
          "module": "file",
          "name": "delete",
          "property": [
            {
              "name": "Path",
              "type": {
                "name": "path"
              },
              "value": "/.browser/SingletonLock"
            }
          ],
          "default": [
            {
              "name": "recursive",
              "type": {
                "name": "bool"
              },
              "value": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "module": "on",
          "name": "error",
          "property": [
            {
              "name": "Key",
              "type": {
                "name": "text"
              },
              "value": "NotFound"
            },
            {
              "name": "Ignore",
              "type": {
                "name": "bool"
              },
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "delete file '/.browser/SingletonSocket', on error 'NotFound' ignore",
      "line": {
        "number": 13
      },
      "code": [
        {
          "module": "file",
          "name": "delete",
